==Chapters==
* Chapter 1: [[DPA28|Look For Giratina!]]
* Chapter 2: [[DPA29|A Clash! Hareta vs. Charon]]
* Chapter 3: [[DPA30|The Anger of Legendary Pokémon Heatran]]
* Chapter 4: [[DPA31|Hareta's Excellent New Partner...Minun?!]]
* Chapter 5: [[DPA32|Charon Must Be Stopped!]]
* Special Chapter: [[DPAS5|Return to Hareta's Home Forest!]]

==Important events==
* [[Jupiter]] and [[Mars]] leave [[Team Galactic]] to search for [[Cyrus]].
* [[Hareta]] and [[Mitsumi]] follow Team Galactic to [[Stark Mountain]], where they meet [[Charon]].
* The Egg given to Hareta by [[Kaisei]] hatches into a {{p|Minun}}.
* [[B-2]] joins Hareta's group as they go to take down Charon and Neo [[Team Galactic]].

